  "text": "In 2021, the US total GDP was $23 trillion and national debt was $28.4 trillion. (a) Calculate the US national debt in 2021 as a percentage of Explain the relationship between a fiscal deficit and the national Which one of the following is the most likely consequence of an increase in the\nUS national increase in:\nA crowding out\nB inequality\nC poverty\nD unemployment",
